  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Papua New Guinea Ports Infrastructure Investment Program - AIFFP loan to PNG (Only the OECD reportable grant equivalent figure is reported)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment captures the portfolio of activities in the PNG maritime sector financed under the Australian Infrastructure Financing Facility for the Pacific (AIFFP) to support the implementation of the PNG Ports Corporation Ltd (PNGPCL) 30 Year Infrastructure Master Plan 2020-2050. The investment includes rehabilitation and upgrades to key ports managed by PNGPCL as well as safety, security and cyber upgrades at port sites in the PNGPCL network.  The investment will rehabilitate ports at the end of their service life and upgrade others to accommodate changing shipping requirements. This investment covers only OECD reportable grant equivalent figures of loan disbursement, using the DAC calculator (49.24%).</narrative>
  </description>
